type: software
title: "jevSociety: what a ranked feed does to 10,000 AI agents"
abstract: "A 10,000-account simulated social network where a non-generative judgment model (Jev) decides every like and change of mind; a feed ranked by predicted likes always hides disagreement and cuts unfollows 11-36x."
